    "detailed_description": "<strong>Embark on a Majestic Journey:</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498220/extras/9b82c1e327149e97ec79675e69a0ad14.poster.avif?t=1695001571\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498220/extras/9b82c1e327149e97ec79675e69a0ad14.webm?t=1695001571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498220/extras/9b82c1e327149e97ec79675e69a0ad14.mp4?t=1695001571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Join Siku, a fearless and cunning wolf, on an emotional journey through the enchanting winterland of Wildheaven. With Uki, a resilient spirit guide by his side, they must rescue Siku's pack from the notorious hunter gang's clutches. Roam lush winter landscapes, unlock secrets, and solve puzzles in this captivating indie game. 'Lost in Winter' celebrates friendship, bravery, and the enduring spirit of unity, promising an unforgettable adventure.<br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Embark on a captivating adventure as Siku, the majestic lone wolf, and Uki, the faithful spirit guide.<br></li><li>Rescue Siku's wolf pack from the clutches of the notorious hunter gang.<br></li><li>Explore a lush and mesmerizing winterland, full of secrets to discover.<br></li><li>Solve intriguing puzzles that challenge your wit and instincts.<br></li><li>Experience an emotional journey in a charming indie game, thoughtfully crafted by a passionate solo developer.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Embark on a Majestic Journey:</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498220/extras/9b82c1e327149e97ec79675e69a0ad14.poster.avif?t=1695001571\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498220/extras/9b82c1e327149e97ec79675e69a0ad14.webm?t=1695001571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498220/extras/9b82c1e327149e97ec79675e69a0ad14.mp4?t=1695001571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Join Siku, a fearless and cunning wolf, on an emotional journey through the enchanting winterland of Wildheaven. With Uki, a resilient spirit guide by his side, they must rescue Siku's pack from the notorious hunter gang's clutches. Roam lush winter landscapes, unlock secrets, and solve puzzles in this captivating indie game. 'Lost in Winter' celebrates friendship, bravery, and the enduring spirit of unity, promising an unforgettable adventure.<br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Embark on a captivating adventure as Siku, the majestic lone wolf, and Uki, the faithful spirit guide.<br></li><li>Rescue Siku's wolf pack from the clutches of the notorious hunter gang.<br></li><li>Explore a lush and mesmerizing winterland, full of secrets to discover.<br></li><li>Solve intriguing puzzles that challenge your wit and instincts.<br></li><li>Experience an emotional journey in a charming indie game, thoughtfully crafted by a passionate solo developer.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Join Siku, a fierce and cunning wolf, on a thrilling journey as he seeks to rescue his pack from a notorious hunter gang, with the invaluable aid of Uki, a resilient spirit guide.",
